---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affluenza"
  description="Art, photography, reflections, and personal discovery."
>
  <main class="site-container">
    <section class="intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Affluenza.ca</p>

      <h1>A greater awareness of ourselves.</h1>

      <div class="reading-width">
        <p>
          Affluenza can be described as a highly contagious, socially transmitted sickness of abundant wealth, an unhealthy obsession with material goods, and the addiction for more. Some side effects include a false sense of accomplishment, emptiness, unnecessary debt, and an abundant amount of needless shit.
        </p>

        <p>
          Over time, Affluenza has come to mean something different for me.
        </p>

        <p>
          For me, Affluenza is the sickness of believing that more will make us whole, when what we truly need is a greater awareness of ourselves.
        </p>

        <p>
          With that being said…
        </p>

        <p>
          I’m done living a life in and of recovery. I’m ready to just live my life. Live my life as a friend, a brother, an uncle, a son, simply as me. Live my life as an explorer. Live my life as an artist. Simply live my life through discovery.
        </p>

        <p>
          This website is where I will share my discoveries.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding-block: 6rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--colour-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 11ch;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .reading-width {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.5vw, 1.3rem);
  }
</style>